{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14830","headline":"同兵部李纾侍郎刑部包佶侍郎哭皇甫侍御曾 · 卢纶","name":"同兵部李纾侍郎刑部包佶侍郎哭皇甫侍御曾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"攀龙与泣麟，哀乐不同尘。\n九陌霄汉侣，一灯冥漠人。\n舟沈惊海阔，兰折怨霜频。\n已矣复何见，故山应更春。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14830.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14830","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}